            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">AI Strategy</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
              <li>• AI opportunity assessment</li>
              <li>• Workflow automation design</li>
              <li>• Tool selection & integration</li>
              <li>• ROI measurement frameworks</li>
              <li>• Change management for AI adoption</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-50 dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-700 p-8 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
